Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.79,0:00:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.91,0:01:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.09,0:01:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We're outnumbered. Let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.19,0:01:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.87,0:01:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.25,0:01:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura's retreat may be an\Nattempt to lead us into a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.93,0:01:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, have your men follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.99,0:01:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then have the Royal Guard evacuate\Nall civilians to the palace courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.01,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.81,0:01:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's in the palace courtyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.87,0:01:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be safe there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.67,0:01:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no sign of the pharaoh anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.13,0:01:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Slifer the Sky Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I call upon Duos!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.99,0:01:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Crack down Bacora!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.87,0:01:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Helamai!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.37,0:01:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:01:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be near!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.39,0:01:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It hides by night!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.05,0:02:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well put, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.53,0:02:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.33,0:02:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kareem!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're to defeat him,\Nyou must stand tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.37,0:02:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now wipe the sweat from your\Nbrow and rise above this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of Egypt depends upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.73,0:02:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.51,0:02:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is no telling\Nwhere that creature lurks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.39,0:02:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Or where it will strike next.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.19,0:02:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We must follow! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.79,0:02:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura has already become\Nmore powerful than I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.23,0:02:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be stopped before he\Ngains another Millennium Idol!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew his highness could\Nbe led astray so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.69,0:02:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reign ends now, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Slifer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.45,0:03:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Seek and destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we defend ourselves\Nfrom an enemy we cannot see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Our pharaoh controls the Egyptian gods,\Nthe most powerful beings in this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.09,0:03:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've kept you in suspense long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.89,0:03:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Diabal, time to make yourself known.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.17,0:03:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Biblical Shockwave!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sliver, it's your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.15,0:03:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack with Thunder Force Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Master Agnardin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.27,0:04:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you, Seto
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.99,0:04:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Duos, or a sword attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A direct hit
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.25,0:04:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, Seto
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.77,0:04:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think you destroyed Deerbound?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.77,0:04:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Another monster? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.69,0:05:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's not a strategy\NI haven't prepared for, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.11,0:05:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Must fight on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.41,0:05:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Farrow, you are\Nfar too weak for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.11,0:05:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't give up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Farrow! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.55,0:05:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.39,0:05:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right? Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.59,0:05:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous. Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.91,0:05:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How could those four brats\Nhave infiltrated this realm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.21,0:05:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come too far to\Nturn back now, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.11,0:05:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are a team, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.77,0:05:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel my energy returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot how strong my\Nbond with you he truly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.97,0:05:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Akura, your reign of\Nterror ends here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You've disgraced the Egyptian\Ngods, and for that you must pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forth, winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.65,0:06:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,cast thy rage upon this enemy of egypt no\Nhow can he summon a beast this powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.89,0:06:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it be the Egyptian sun god,\Nthe mighty winged dragon of Ra?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.29,0:06:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,this doesn't make any sense\Nwhen I destroyed Slifer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.15,0:06:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the sky dragon the pharaoh\Nwas rendered powerless,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,so where did he find the strength to\Ncall upon yet another Egyptian god?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.07,0:07:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, unless this has something\Nto do with those meddling kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,did reuniting with his former host\Nsomehow restore the pharaoh's life force?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,once again we shall save mankind together,\Nand I wouldn't have it any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the gods of Egypt can cause the\Nsun to illuminate in the dead of night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the darkness, his Diabound\Nhas no way of concealing itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you fool see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.85,0:07:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the Pharaoh, I wield the power\Nof an Egyptian god as well. Diabound!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder Force, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.52,0:07:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall protect you with my mighty duos!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:08:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the power of your aura\Nsword to stop Makora's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,attack and shield the\Nwinged dragon from harm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see this doesn't concern you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, now's your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Great deity of the sun, I ask\Nthee to transform thyself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, burn through the\Nshadows with your fiery rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice is served.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.87,0:08:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The darkness is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This creature is destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.65,0:08:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Pharaoh has restored\Npeace to Egypt once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I too late to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.87,0:09:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Had it not been for Yugi's bravery, Bakura\Nwould surely have reigned victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.61,0:09:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But once again, it seems\Nthat friendship conquers all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it, you just won, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Egypt is now safe, but none of it\Nwould have been possible without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.71,0:09:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one that did all the work!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But you gave me the strength I\Nneeded to fight, so thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, we're a team!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't forget the rest of the team!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.97,0:09:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All for one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.03,0:09:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And one for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.47,0:09:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I know this was coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Pharaoh, even two continents in\Nover 5,000 years couldn't keep us apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Buzz is touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I love a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.63,0:09:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't supposed to end like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I won't let it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.49,0:10:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands of time, reverse thyself\Nso that I may alter the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.89,0:10:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My king, we must leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.87,0:10:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is time flowing backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Trio!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.83,0:10:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.09,0:10:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, to pick up where I left off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My barrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it me, or did we run\Nthrough this town already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.01,0:11:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.07,0:11:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having some major deja vu, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.01,0:11:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Bakura? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.31,0:11:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought back some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.39,0:11:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try this again, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the tables have turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.33,0:11:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I want what's rightfully mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.75,0:11:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your puzzle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.87,0:11:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where you're going, you'll\Nhave no use for it, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.19,0:11:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Join the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.93,0:11:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Valkyra?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.83,0:11:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Karim.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.21,0:12:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We must lead a search for the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.59,0:12:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.91,0:12:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Valkyra!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for the Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.23,0:12:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I like your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.01,0:12:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can use you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we talk about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Scarface!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let my pal go! Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.19,0:12:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.37,0:12:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was working alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And you thought wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.43,0:12:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You must hurry, my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Run this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.89,0:12:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I know a shotgun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.59,0:12:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in control of this shadow game,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.17,0:12:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and reversing the hands of time was\Na mere taste of what I'm capable of!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.91,0:13:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I have five more\NMillennium items to seize!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.79,0:13:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You are all safe now, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All except for one. Tristan's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.91,0:13:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to find the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.75,0:13:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But this was a shadow\Ngame and, well, he lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.45,0:13:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone we know that lost a\Nshadow game lost their soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.45,0:13:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, the Pharaoh's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what Shadi said?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.05,0:13:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the world of\Nthe Pharaoh's memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.69,0:13:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.19,0:13:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.35,0:13:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's still here, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.07,0:13:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Pharaoh must be here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.19,0:13:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If his memories are still\Nhere, then he's here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.87,0:14:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So now all we have to do is search\Nthis place until we find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.81,0:14:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.43,0:14:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We got this far, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.81,0:14:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest should be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.59,0:14:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Bakura's evil rampage never cease?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.61,0:14:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,First Mahad was attacked,\Nand now Master Akhnadhan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.69,0:14:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Millennium Key, guide his spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Agnaden, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.01,0:14:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, speak to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.87,0:14:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadda, have you found\Nany strong souls? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.79,0:14:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto and I came across a\Nyoung peasant girl who's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,harboring a creature so powerful\Nit could not be measured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.77,0:14:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Her power was even too strong\Nfor the Millennium Key to detect?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, with all due respect,\Nyou need your rest, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.15,0:14:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.85,0:14:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.07,0:15:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We have scoured the kingdom and\Nstill no sign of the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you have to drain the river Nile,\NI want him found! Yes, sir. Know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,His majesty still walks this earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we expect Egypt to survive,\Nour king must return to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.01,0:15:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis, can you see what the future holds?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.93,0:15:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,One tiny ripple moves\Nacross a sea of shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.37,0:15:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As it spreads, one among us will vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,More ripples will follow,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.39,0:15:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and before long they will merge\Nto form a devastating force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.07,0:15:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Isis, does this foretell\Nthe fate of our kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.95,0:15:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shimon, I fear this foretells\Nthe fate of the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The order brought about by the seven\Nmillennium items is falling apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and I thought it would last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.97,0:15:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How could one man have caused all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:15:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean Akhenaten is gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.77,0:15:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When he awoke, I told him of\Nthe young peasant girl we found,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and he stormed out in a fit of rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.73,0:16:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards, where has our guest gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you knew, Master Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.69,0:16:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Akhenaten took her to the\Nsubterranean battleground.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.77,0:16:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.23,0:16:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.43,0:16:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I can clarify the\Nsituation, Master Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.21,0:16:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.81,0:16:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the battle commence!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Akhenaten has gone mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.90,0:16:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be resting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.33,0:16:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know the rules of combat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.69,0:16:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now strike down your opponent,\Nlest you be struck down yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.01,0:16:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say opponent?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I said attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.15,0:17:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Ak-Nah-Din, have\Nyou lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Forcing prisoners to engage in\Nbattle for your own amusement?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.03,0:17:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I cannot allow this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.01,0:17:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You must cease at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.59,0:17:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.85,0:17:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you not see that I am\Nexecuting your idea? Observe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster is growing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I took your plan to the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.21,0:17:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You suggested we collect an\Narmy of shadow creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but not like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.31,0:17:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I found a way to grow them by\Nforcing them to fight for survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.09,0:17:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,As their rage increases,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.89,0:17:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so does the strength of the beast\Nthat dwells within their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.49,0:17:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to finish you off! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.31,0:17:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall never take me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.85,0:17:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, I understand\Nthe pharaoh is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.43,0:17:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's about time\Nwe made the necessary provisions?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.15,0:18:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh is out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.05,0:18:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The royal guard is searching\Nfor him as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.09,0:18:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Be realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.61,0:18:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to call a\Nnew pharaoh to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.45,0:18:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone who can save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like you, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.53,0:18:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But you cannot leave this empire alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You will need an army of\Npowerful creatures whose
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,might rivals that of the\NEgyptian gods themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.69,0:18:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is exactly what\NI am creating for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.59,0:18:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what dark forces are at work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.89,0:18:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for the real battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.87,0:18:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards lead our next\Nprisoner to the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.73,0:18:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.15,0:18:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot be serious about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.57,0:18:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.48,0:18:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can assure you that this young woman is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.99,0:18:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,not the meek peasant\Ngirl she appears to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.89,0:18:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She harbors the most dangerous\Nshadow creature we've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.71,0:19:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an outrage!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.35,0:19:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not stand here while\Nyou endanger an innocent girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.05,0:19:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she is powerful, she has\Ndone nothing to deserve this! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.87,0:19:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being so naive! Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.85,0:19:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.87,0:19:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,the innocent must be punished in order to\Nbenefit the greater good of our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, this girl may be the\Nkey to the survival of Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no other way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.57,0:19:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let the battle begin!
